[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5940.07, "timestamp": "01:39:00", "text": "梅诺。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5942.709, "timestamp": "01:39:02", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5946.55, "timestamp": "01:39:06", "text": "亚历克斯。好的。哪个号码可以给你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5949.59, "timestamp": "01:39:09", "text": "想？呃，你自己选吧，或者我可以做主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5951.51, "timestamp": "01:39:11", "text": "还是想要黑色。我的意思是，它会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5954.229, "timestamp": "01:39:14", "text": "黑色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5957.51, "timestamp": "01:39:17", "text": "嗯，是的，我总能掌控一切。所以，让我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5972.47, "timestamp": "01:39:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5975.27, "timestamp": "01:39:35", "text": "当心。当心。别搞砸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5976.71, "timestamp": "01:39:36", "text": "向上。"}]